### Works in IntelliJ (HTTP client) and VS Code (REST Client extension)
@base = http://localhost:8080

### Dashboard numbers
GET {{base}}/api/reports/summary

### All donors / filtered
GET {{base}}/api/donors
###
GET {{base}}/api/donors?bloodGroup=O%2B&city=Ahmedabad

### One donor + can he donate today?
GET {{base}}/api/donors/1
###
GET {{base}}/api/donors/3/eligibility

### Register a donor (201)
POST {{base}}/api/donors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Isha Rathod",
  "email": "isha.rathod@mail.com",
  "phone": "9811122233",
  "bloodGroup": "O-",
  "city": "Ahmedabad",
  "dateOfBirth": "1999-10-05"
}

### Same email again (409)
POST {{base}}/api/donors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Isha Rathod",
  "email": "isha.rathod@mail.com",
  "phone": "9811122233",
  "bloodGroup": "O-",
  "city": "Ahmedabad",
  "dateOfBirth": "1999-10-05"
}

### Validation errors (400)
POST {{base}}/api/donors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "", "email": "not-an-email", "phone": "123", "bloodGroup": "A+", "city": "", "dateOfBirth": "2030-01-01" }

### Under age (422)
POST {{base}}/api/donors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Young Kid", "email": "kid@mail.com", "phone": "9811100000", "bloodGroup": "B+", "city": "Surat", "dateOfBirth": "2015-01-01" }

### Wrong blood group value (400)
POST {{base}}/api/donors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Test", "email": "t@mail.com", "phone": "9811100000", "bloodGroup": "Z+", "city": "Surat", "dateOfBirth": "1995-01-01" }

### Donor not found (404)
GET {{base}}/api/donors/999

### Bad id type (400)
GET {{base}}/api/donors/abc

### Deactivate donor (204)
DELETE {{base}}/api/donors/10

### Hospitals
GET {{base}}/api/hospitals
###
POST {{base}}/api/hospitals
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Shree Care Hospital", "city": "Rajkot", "contactNumber": "0281234567", "registrationNo": "GJ-RJT-3301" }

### Open requests (critical first)
GET {{base}}/api/requests?status=OPEN

### New emergency request (201)
POST {{base}}/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hospitalId": 1,
  "patientName": "Mahesh Chauhan",
  "bloodGroup": "B+",
  "unitsNeeded": 2,
  "urgency": "CRITICAL",
  "requiredBy": "2026-12-31"
}

### Who can we call for request 1?
GET {{base}}/api/requests/1/matches

### Record a donation straight to request 1 (201)
POST {{base}}/api/donations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "donorId": 2, "requestId": 1 }

### Same donor again -> 90 day rule (422)
POST {{base}}/api/donations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "donorId": 2, "requestId": 1 }

### Incompatible group: B+ donor (id 3 is blocked by gap anyway, use a B donor) to an A+ request
POST {{base}}/api/donations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "donorId": 9, "requestId": 1 }

### Donation into general stock (no request)
POST {{base}}/api/donations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "donorId": 1 }

### Stock
GET {{base}}/api/stock
###
GET {{base}}/api/stock/O+
###
POST {{base}}/api/stock/O_POS/add?units=4

### Serve request 1 from stock / cancel it
POST {{base}}/api/requests/1/fulfill-from-stock
###
POST {{base}}/api/requests/3/cancel

### Wrong method (405)
DELETE {{base}}/api/requests

### Unknown url (404)
GET {{base}}/api/nothing-here

### SOAP: use docs/soap/*.xml with Postman/SoapUI, or curl:
# curl -H "Content-Type: text/xml" -d @docs/soap/check-stock.xml http://localhost:8080/ws
# WSDL:  http://localhost:8080/ws/bloodlink.wsdl
